{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_8358153F","title":"Complex ending","entry":"Dlg_8358153F::entry","exit":"Dlg_8358153F::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_A7AECEAA","articyId":"72057645577595777","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"They say when you hear your name in a dream, you wake up. Is your name Thaddeus?","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"They say when you hear your name in a dream, you wake up. Is your name Thaddeus?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":625.0,"y":376.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41708","byteOffset":30107848,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_70D3FD5D","articyId":"72057645577595807","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"No. But he sent a message last night. I'll play it for you.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No. But he sent a message last night. I'll play it for you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1825.0,"y":376.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52623","byteOffset":34322000,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_D4073E57","articyId":"72057645577595819","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"If you're getting this message, it means the process failed. I guess it was my time. Damn, I feel tired though. I just wanted to clear up some things before I shuffle off stage.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"If you're getting this message, it means the process failed. I guess it was my time. Damn, I feel tired though. I just wanted to clear up some things before I shuffle off stage.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2125.0,"y":376.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38039","byteOffset":28725848,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_E133B5E1","articyId":"72057645577595891","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"You uncovered more about my true nature than anyone else has for a thousand years. In any other epoch, I would have had you killed to protect those secrets. Now though, all I want is to scream them out loud for the world to hear.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You uncovered more about my true nature than anyone else has for a thousand years. In any other epoch, I would have had you killed to protect those secrets. Now though, all I want is to scream them out loud for the world to hear.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2725.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40202","byteOffset":29539520,"byteLength":576}},{"id":"DFr_EE59705B","articyId":"72057645577595960","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"Just one more thing kid. I.... No. No, you don't need to know all that. Nivalis is a wild ride. I hope you enjoy your trip. See you on the next turning. You know... at one time, I was everywhere...","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Just one more thing kid. I.... No. No, you don't need to know all that. Nivalis is a wild ride. I hope you enjoy your trip. See you on the next turning. You know... at one time, I was everywhere...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5425.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43372","byteOffset":30738192,"byteLength":508}},{"id":"DFr_66A1A3E9","articyId":"72057821671327848","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"No. He sent a message last night. I'll play it for you.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No. He sent a message last night. I'll play it for you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1829.939453125,"y":627.965087890625},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23188","byteOffset":16655840,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_0107762F","articyId":"72057821671327906","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"I hope we learn the truth.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I hope we learn the truth.","TextSheVersion":"I hope we learn the truth.","TextTheyVersion":"I hope we learn the truth."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3025.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48933","byteOffset":32853032,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_0038F8B5","articyId":"72057821671327912","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"Can we believe him now?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Can we believe him now?","TextSheVersion":"Can we believe him now?","TextTheyVersion":"Can we believe him now?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3025.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39980","byteOffset":29454368,"byteLength":332}},{"id":"DFr_6DC60692","articyId":"72057821671327922","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"I knew it.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I knew it.","TextSheVersion":"I knew it.","TextTheyVersion":"I knew it."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3625.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32164","byteOffset":20048720,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_09F6F312","articyId":"72057645577595783","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Huh?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Huh?","TextSheVersion":"Huh?","TextTheyVersion":"Huh?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":925.0,"y":301.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18812","byteOffset":15004296,"byteLength":284}},{"id":"DFr_AB87B346","articyId":"72057645577595789","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"No!","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No!","TextSheVersion":"No!","TextTheyVersion":"No!"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":925.0,"y":526.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17187","byteOffset":14392104,"byteLength":284}},{"id":"DFr_8A013743","articyId":"72057645577595795","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"It seems... The process failed.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It seems... The process failed.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1225.0,"y":376.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52069","byteOffset":34113728,"byteLength":348}},{"id":"DFr_6080ED65","articyId":"72057645577595801","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"So I don't have Thaddeus's memories?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So I don't have Thaddeus's memories?","TextSheVersion":"So I don't have Thaddeus's memories?","TextTheyVersion":"So I don't have Thaddeus's memories?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1525.0,"y":376.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42406","byteOffset":30370592,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_B9E29668","articyId":"72057645577595813","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"The message origin is clear. It came from Sang-Ha. I believe he was there all along.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The message origin is clear. It came from Sang-Ha. I believe he was there all along.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2425.0,"y":376.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35181","byteOffset":25670696,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_D97B43AD","articyId":"72057645577595905","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"You might have put two and two together by now, and came out with infinity. Turns out, that answer is correct. I'm more than one person, more than a few. I passed memories - pieces of myself - on to Banor, Huckstash, Gunger and more.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You might have put two and two together by now, and came out with infinity. Turns out, that answer is correct. I'm more than one person, more than a few. I passed memories - pieces of myself - on to Banor, Huckstash, Gunger and more.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3325.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38089","byteOffset":28744376,"byteLength":516}},{"id":"DFr_FC82D872","articyId":"72057645577595919","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"None of them could tell you the truth, because my influence prevented it. Part of the condition of taking my memories, and a part of my personality, is that they cannot reveal the truth, even if they wanted to.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"None of them could tell you the truth, because my influence prevented it. Part of the condition of taking my memories, and a part of my personality, is that they cannot reveal the truth, even if they wanted to.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3925.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38088","byteOffset":28743880,"byteLength":492}},{"id":"DFr_729861A5","articyId":"72057645577595926","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"They won't be affected by Thaddeus's death, but... they won't lose the memories either. And they won't be able to reveal any of his secrets, even now.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"They won't be affected by Thaddeus's death, but... they won't lose the memories either. And they won't be able to reveal any of his secrets, even now.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4225.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19585","byteOffset":15292424,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_4A00DAB4","articyId":"72057645577595933","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"Those memories were no longer inside me, but they were close by, close enough to touch. And that kept me going... far longer than it should have. I always treated my friends well, as I hope I did with you too.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Those memories were no longer inside me, but they were close by, close enough to touch. And that kept me going... far longer than it should have. I always treated my friends well, as I hope I did with you too.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4525.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27066","byteOffset":18119000,"byteLength":492}},{"id":"DFr_BD882359","articyId":"72057645577595940","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"Do you think he treated you well?","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Do you think he treated you well?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4825.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19921","byteOffset":15420784,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_D00CEF63","articyId":"72057645577595947","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Yes.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yes.","TextSheVersion":"Yes.","TextTheyVersion":"Yes."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5125.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18273","byteOffset":14799872,"byteLength":284}},{"id":"DFr_B42CE89C","articyId":"72057645577595952","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"No.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No.","TextSheVersion":"No.","TextTheyVersion":"No."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5125.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43473","byteOffset":30776224,"byteLength":284}},{"id":"DFr_1ACF75CB","articyId":"72057645577595969","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"That's it. Thaddeus is gone.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That's it. Thaddeus is gone.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5725.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18514","byteOffset":14889960,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_7AA43F90","articyId":"72057821671327842","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I'm quite relieved. He's finally gone?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm quite relieved. He's finally gone?","TextSheVersion":"I'm quite relieved. He's finally gone?","TextTheyVersion":"I'm quite relieved. He's finally gone?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1529.939453125,"y":627.965087890625},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29021","byteOffset":18861360,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"Dlg_8358153F::entry","type":"entry","text":"Complex ending","speaker":null,"effects":[],"conditions":[]},{"id":"Dlg_8358153F::exit","type":"exit","text":"Complex ending","speaker":null,"effects":[],"conditions":[]},{"id":"Ins_FACD3BFA","type":"external","text":"// unlock recipe: Cyber Shot","speaker":null,"effects":[],"conditions":[],"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22076","byteOffset":16238464,"byteLength":372}}],"edges":[{"id":"Dlg_8358153F::entry:72057624102704020:0","from":"Dlg_8358153F::entry","to":"DFr_A7AECEAA","fromPin":"72057624102704020","toPin":"72057645577595778","targetPinRole":"input","pinOrder":0,"order":0,"label":"","effects":[],"script":"Thaddeus.Truth >= 2 && Thaddeus.Truth <= 4","conditions":["Thaddeus.Truth >= 2 && Thaddeus.Truth <= 4"]},{"id":"DFr_A7AECEAA:72057645577595779:0","from":"DFr_A7AECEAA","to":"DFr_AB87B346","fromPin":"72057645577595779","toPin":"72057645577595790","targetPinRole":"input","pinOrder":0,"order":0,"label":"","effects":[],"script":"","conditions":[]},{"id":"DFr_A7AECEAA:72057645577595779:1","from":"DFr_A7AECEAA","to":"DFr_09F6F312","fromPin":"72057645577595779","toPin":"72057645577595784","targetPinRo